WEBVTT


00:00:55.854 --> 00:00:58.186
Um, so, anyway...


00:00:58.257 --> 00:01:00.782
thank you all so much
for being here and...


00:01:00.859 --> 00:01:04.351
<i>uh, let's eat some cake.</i>


00:01:15.407 --> 00:01:17.398
<i>Careful!</i>


00:01:20.045 --> 00:01:22.605
<i>- Ben, you're gonna drop me.
- I am gonna drop you.</i>


00:01:22.681 --> 00:01:25.673
God.


00:01:31.056 --> 00:01:34.048
- Mmm, stay just like that.
- Ben-


00:01:34.126 --> 00:01:37.618
<i>- Enough with the pictures!
- Come on!</i>


00:01:37.696 --> 00:01:40.529
You look beautiful!
They should be preserved for all of time.


00:01:40.599 --> 00:01:42.863
This is what I get
for marrying a photographer.


00:01:45.437 --> 00:01:50.170
What are you doing
so far away from me?


00:01:50.242 --> 00:01:53.734
The most beautiful blushing bride
in all of Brooklyn.


00:01:53.812 --> 00:01:55.746
Oh.


00:01:58.717 --> 00:02:00.878
You have been wonderful
about this whole thing.


00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:03.547
- Yes, I have been wonderful.
- Yes, you have.


00:02:03.622 --> 00:02:05.556
I promise you, I will make it fun.


00:02:05.624 --> 00:02:08.286
Just think, the first stamp
in your new passport is gonna beJapan.


00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:11.921
- How cool is that?
- That is cool. That is really cool.


00:02:14.032 --> 00:02:17.365
Well, the car will
be here in an hour.


00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:21.202
You better hurry up if you're gonna
get this thing consummated.


00:03:41.019 --> 00:03:43.146
God, look at that.


00:03:43.222 --> 00:03:47.158
- Mmm, it's beautiful, huh?
- It's gorgeous!


00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:49.194
Real quick. Get in the picture.


00:03:49.261 --> 00:03:52.924
Uh-oh.


00:04:17.623 --> 00:04:19.557
Ben.


00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:23.052
Baby, I'm sorry.
Can you check the map?


00:04:23.128 --> 00:04:24.720
I am so lost. I think-


00:04:24.796 --> 00:04:27.629
- Sorry to wake you up.
- Mmm, it's okay.


00:04:33.805 --> 00:04:36.239
<i>Did you cross a bridge?</i>


00:04:36.308 --> 00:04:40.039
- What was the last thing that you passed?
- Uh, this intersection about-


00:05:28.126 --> 00:05:31.095
Jane. Jane?


00:05:31.163 --> 00:05:32.892
Jane, honey, are you okay?


00:05:32.964 --> 00:05:34.898
There was a girl.
We hit a girl.


00:05:39.338 --> 00:05:42.330
<i>- There was a girl on the road.
- Okay. Okay.</i>


00:05:42.407 --> 00:05:44.967
I think she might be dead.


00:05:45.043 --> 00:05:47.477
- Jesus Christ.
- There's nothing here, Jane.


00:05:47.546 --> 00:05:51.073
- Oh, I might've killed someone.
- Janie, there's nothin' here.


00:05:51.149 --> 00:05:53.743
She could be covered in the snow.
Ben, we have to find her.


00:05:53.819 --> 00:05:57.414
- Janie, there's no blood. There's nothing here.
- We have to find her.


00:05:57.489 --> 00:05:59.889
Let me get you back in the car.
It is freezing out here.


00:05:59.958 --> 00:06:02.017
I'm gonna call the police.
I'll get us some help.


00:06:24.082 --> 00:06:26.016
- They can't just leave.
- Honey-


00:06:26.084 --> 00:06:29.884
They searched the woods.
They called the hospitals. There's nothing.


00:06:29.955 --> 00:06:32.822
They think we hit an animal.
You're absolutely positive that it was a girl?


00:06:32.891 --> 00:06:34.984
Ben, she was standing right here.


00:06:36.228 --> 00:06:39.664
Okay. Look, there's nothing else
we can do tonight.


00:06:39.731 --> 00:06:43.667
So can we please, please just go?


00:06:53.145 --> 00:06:56.114
Oh, man.


00:07:03.288 --> 00:07:06.553
Oh, man.


00:07:07.626 --> 00:07:09.560
I think I tweaked somethin'
back there.


00:07:15.133 --> 00:07:17.499
We did everything we could, Jane.


00:07:17.569 --> 00:07:21.972
<i>Look, we've only got a couple of days
before I start work. Let's try and enjoy it.</i>


00:07:23.041 --> 00:07:25.066
What do you say
I make us some green tea?


00:07:25.143 --> 00:07:27.475
And then we can sleep for a year.


00:07:27.546 --> 00:07:29.480
<i>Maybe two.</i>


00:07:29.548 --> 00:07:31.709
Yeah.


00:07:50.936 --> 00:07:54.497
<i>Janie, I forgot how beautiful
the light is out here.</i>


00:07:54.573 --> 00:07:58.236
We have got-
To start taking some pictures.


00:08:01.646 --> 00:08:06.015
What would a girl have been doing in the
middle of the road wearing a dress like that?


00:08:06.084 --> 00:08:09.781
<i>Jane, honey,
we have talked about this.</i>


00:08:09.855 --> 00:08:12.915
If there was a girl- If-


00:08:12.991 --> 00:08:15.391
Then somebody must have stopped
and got her some help.


00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:18.452
- I know. I just- I can't-
- Jane, please.


00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.464
Stop being so dramatic about this.


00:08:20.532 --> 00:08:22.466
If there was a girl,
I promise you...


00:08:22.534 --> 00:08:26.061
she is somewhere right now sitting in bed,
eating ice cream and having her cast signed.


00:08:26.137 --> 00:08:28.901
Come with me, and let's take some photographs.


00:08:31.176 --> 00:08:35.135
- Baby, do they even have ice cream in Japan?
- Yes, they do.


00:08:35.213 --> 00:08:37.238
- But... it's fish flavored.
- Oh, okay.


00:08:37.315 --> 00:08:42.048
Right- No, no. Right-
Perfect. One second.


00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:45.317
- Ben, it's really cold.
- I know. I'm comin'.


00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:47.551
Okay, okay.
First, one for Mom.


00:08:47.626 --> 00:08:49.218
<i>A family portrait.</i>


00:08:50.729 --> 00:08:52.390
Can I press the button?


00:08:52.464 --> 00:08:53.988
- You wanna press the button?
- I wanna press the button.


00:08:56.067 --> 00:08:59.036
<i>- That's why they pay me the big bucks.
- Jane is cold.</i>


00:08:59.104 --> 00:09:02.096
<i>- Jane's cold.
- We should definitely, definitely warm Jane up.</i>


00:09:26.031 --> 00:09:27.020
<i>Ben-san!</i>


00:09:29.668 --> 00:09:32.159
Yoko.


00:09:38.176 --> 00:09:40.872
Yoko.


00:09:40.946 --> 00:09:42.208
- Oh.
- Hi.


00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:44.043
Wife?


00:09:44.115 --> 00:09:46.879
- Congratulations.
- Thank you.


00:09:46.952 --> 00:09:49.785
- And congratulations on the job.
- Thank you.


00:09:49.854 --> 00:09:51.788
<i>Ben-san!</i>


00:09:51.856 --> 00:09:53.847
- See ya.
- Bruno! Look at you!


00:09:53.925 --> 00:09:56.621
- Oh!
- Two years!


00:09:56.695 --> 00:09:58.629
- Like you never left.
- Maybe I shouldn't have.


00:09:58.697 --> 00:10:00.995
Oh, come on. Come on.
This must beJane.


00:10:01.066 --> 00:10:03.193
Uh, yes. Bruno, Jane.
Jane, Bruno.


00:10:03.268 --> 00:10:05.202
- Congratulations.
- Thank you.


00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:08.034
- Sorry I couldn't make it, but-
- Oh, Ben's told me so much about you.


00:10:08.106 --> 00:10:10.666
Oh, hopefully the good stuff.


00:10:10.742 --> 00:10:13.404
And I'm sorry we cut short
your honeymoon.


00:10:13.478 --> 00:10:15.969
In fact, I got the client
upstairs waiting.


00:10:16.047 --> 00:10:18.277
- Oh, don't worry about me. Go.
- Okay.


00:10:19.884 --> 00:10:22.648
<i>- Good luck.
- I'm sorry I'm late, man. The traffic was a killer.</i>


00:10:22.721 --> 00:10:25.189
<i>Don't worry about it.
You're the genius photographer.</i>


00:10:25.256 --> 00:10:28.692
<i>That's why I brought you out here.</i>


00:10:32.764 --> 00:10:36.200
We finalized the last of the models.
Did you get the Polaroids we sent over?


00:10:36.267 --> 00:10:38.997
I did get the Polaroids. There's a couple
I'd like to meet in person.


00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:41.061
- Yeah, I bet there is.
- Oh, come on.


00:10:41.139 --> 00:10:43.471
Talk to Adam about that tomorrow.


00:10:43.541 --> 00:10:45.771
Now, the clients are eager to get going.


00:10:45.844 --> 00:10:49.712
And I think I should mention they are
very pleased with our choice of photographer.


00:10:49.781 --> 00:10:51.908
- You ready?
- Ready.


00:11:12.103 --> 00:11:16.597
So, it's a loft conversion, but it's much nicer
on the inside. No, no. Let me get that.


00:11:18.677 --> 00:11:22.374
All the comforts of home.


00:11:22.447 --> 00:11:24.438
Right this way.


00:11:26.518 --> 00:11:30.386
<i>Ah. Here is the photo studio.</i>


00:11:30.455 --> 00:11:32.389
<i>Come on in.</i>


00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.394
Hi! Pleasure to meet you.


00:11:41.466 --> 00:11:44.799
Yes, this is your assistant.
Ben Shaw, Seiko Nakamura.


00:11:44.869 --> 00:11:47.838
And this is Ben's wife, Jane.


00:11:47.906 --> 00:11:50.101
- Hi, it's nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you.


00:11:50.175 --> 00:11:52.234
<i>- Does this work?
- Yeah.</i>


00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.676
Let me show you
the darkroom over here...


00:11:54.746 --> 00:11:56.771
for the black-and-white prints.


00:12:00.552 --> 00:12:03.544
Yeah? Will it work?


00:12:03.621 --> 00:12:06.351
<i>- It's good?
- Yeah, yeah. Better than good.</i>


00:12:06.424 --> 00:12:09.518
Good. All right. Well, let's head upstairs,
and we'll check out the rest.


00:12:09.594 --> 00:12:13.621
<i>- People live here?
- Well, yours is the only actual completed unit.</i>


00:12:13.698 --> 00:12:16.098
So, you guys'll have
the whole place to yourselves.


00:12:16.167 --> 00:12:17.930
Be good for a couple
of newlyweds, huh?


00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:30.179
We had, uh, most of this stuff
from another shoot.


00:12:30.248 --> 00:12:33.308
<i>- Figured they wouldn't miss it.
- You always were a sneaky bastard.</i>


00:12:34.619 --> 00:12:36.610
<i>I had, uh, Seiko rent the rest.</i>


00:12:37.856 --> 00:12:40.654
<i>- Not so bad, right?
- Are you kidding? It's great.</i>


00:12:42.827 --> 00:12:44.761
Look at this place.


00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:52.201
<i>- Our stuff.
- I gotta get back to the office.</i>


00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:54.101
Man, you set us up here.


00:12:54.172 --> 00:12:56.163
I want you to know
I really appreciate this job.


00:12:56.241 --> 00:12:59.369
Come on. You make me look good,
you being here.


00:12:59.444 --> 00:13:03.505
Besides, it'll just be like old times.


00:13:03.581 --> 00:13:06.880
<i>- Don't forget. Dinner with Adam.
- Sounds good to me.</i>


00:13:06.951 --> 00:13:08.475
All right. Good night.


00:13:10.255 --> 00:13:12.655
<i>It's huge!</i>


00:13:12.724 --> 00:13:16.888
- My God!
- And it's all ours!


00:13:16.961 --> 00:13:19.361
I mean, Janie,
did you see this view ofTokyo?


00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:21.227
<i>I wish I'd brought up my camera.</i>


00:13:21.299 --> 00:13:25.258
<i>Well, too bad there is nothing else
that we could do...</i>


00:13:26.604 --> 00:13:28.970
up here.


00:13:36.981 --> 00:13:40.178
Mr. Ben Shaw.


00:13:42.821 --> 00:13:45.984
<i>#All these things I say #</i>


00:13:47.192 --> 00:13:51.094
<i># The way you make me feel #</i>


00:13:51.162 --> 00:13:54.131
<i>#All these things I say #</i>


00:13:54.199 --> 00:13:56.224
<i># You are #</i>


00:13:56.301 --> 00:13:59.236
<i># Good to me #</i>


00:13:59.304 --> 00:14:01.272
<i># You are #</i>


00:14:01.339 --> 00:14:04.206
<i># Good to me #</i>


00:14:04.275 --> 00:14:05.742
<i># You are #</i>


00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:08.108
<i># Good to me #</i>


00:15:01.933 --> 00:15:04.265
You gotta get that looked at, honey.


00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:11.133
What's this?


00:15:11.209 --> 00:15:13.177
Just a little surprise.


00:15:14.712 --> 00:15:17.112
It's the honeymoon photographs.
I gave Bruno the film last night.


00:15:17.181 --> 00:15:20.014
Seiko just dropped them off.


00:15:22.053 --> 00:15:23.953
Oh, God, I look hideous.


00:15:26.524 --> 00:15:28.287
What's this?


00:15:30.561 --> 00:15:32.791
I don't know.
Reflection, maybe?


00:15:32.864 --> 00:15:35.230
Or it could just be
a bad frame on the roll.


00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:38.326
- No, it's in a couple of'em.
- Really? Hmm.


00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.828
Maybe I misloaded the film.


00:15:42.907 --> 00:15:46.035
Well, if that's the case,
then we'll just have to reshoot.


00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:47.338
Mmm.


00:15:47.412 --> 00:15:50.313
Enjoy your first day in Tokyo.


00:16:34.926 --> 00:16:37.690
<i>Open your eyes. Just like that.</i>


00:16:37.762 --> 00:16:40.196
Hold that. Hold it.


00:16:40.264 --> 00:16:42.232
<i>Just like that.
Eyes to me.</i>


00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:44.234
Just like that.
Eyes to me.


00:16:44.302 --> 00:16:47.396
Can you drop your hand off the bottle
just a little- Right there. Perfect.


00:16:47.472 --> 00:16:48.939
<i>Hold that. Last couple.</i>


00:16:50.608 --> 00:16:53.975
Lovely. Uh, perfect.


00:16:54.045 --> 00:16:57.105
Okay. Can you bring your hand down
just a little bit on the bottle?


00:16:57.181 --> 00:16:58.910
A little more, more, more.
Okay. Right there, perfect.


00:16:58.983 --> 00:17:00.883
<i>Hold that.
Last couple frames.</i>


00:17:08.359 --> 00:17:10.293
I'm sorry. Excuse me.


00:17:10.361 --> 00:17:14.058
Can you show me how to get to-
I'm looking for, uh-


00:17:35.353 --> 00:17:39.687
<i>Super Lucky!</i>


00:18:01.746 --> 00:18:03.680
Sorry. Sorry.


00:18:11.889 --> 00:18:13.083
- Hey.
- Hi.


00:18:13.157 --> 00:18:15.091
- Hey, baby.
- Hey.


00:18:15.159 --> 00:18:18.026
- How was your first day in Tokyo?
- Uh, it was, um-


00:18:18.096 --> 00:18:20.360
- Mmm.
- Good. Rainy.


00:18:20.431 --> 00:18:23.366
Yeah, you're soaked.
Let's get you out of this.


00:18:23.434 --> 00:18:27.461
- Thank you.
- Megan called. She's sending over the photos from the wedding.


00:18:27.538 --> 00:18:29.699
Oh, that's nice.
I should give her a call.


00:18:29.774 --> 00:18:33.403
You could,
but it's 3:00 a. m. In New York.


00:18:33.478 --> 00:18:35.946
- Yesterday.
- Oh. Mmm.


00:18:36.013 --> 00:18:38.379
- How was your day?
- It's... the office.


00:18:38.449 --> 00:18:41.247
This'll only take a second.
Thank you.


00:18:41.319 --> 00:18:44.447
<i>- Moshi moshi.
- So, where'd you go?</i>


00:18:44.522 --> 00:18:48.185
- Uh, mostly I just walked around.
- Can I see your pictures?


00:18:48.259 --> 00:18:51.057
Sure. They're just tourist shots.


00:18:53.664 --> 00:18:55.188
Oh, God.


00:18:59.504 --> 00:19:02.064
What?


00:19:03.107 --> 00:19:05.541
Spirit photos.


00:19:08.012 --> 00:19:10.344
Hold on.
You know wh-what these are?


00:19:10.414 --> 00:19:14.111
Yeah. My ex-boyfriend works
at a spirit photography magazine.


00:19:14.185 --> 00:19:17.848
- There are whole magazines?
- Yeah.


00:19:17.922 --> 00:19:21.619
Any in English?


00:19:21.692 --> 00:19:24.593
Um, I can introduce you tomorrow, uh,
after the photo shoot.


00:19:24.662 --> 00:19:26.687
- Come on. It'll be fun.
- Um-


00:19:26.764 --> 00:19:28.891
That's cute.
You girls have a date.


00:19:28.966 --> 00:19:32.561
- Uh-Well, I guess so.
- Great.


00:19:39.477 --> 00:19:41.741
Hey. Ah!


00:19:42.747 --> 00:19:44.271
- Jane.
- Long time.


00:19:44.348 --> 00:19:48.216
<i>- Adam, this is myJane. Jane, Adam.
- Hello. I'm Adam.</i>


00:19:48.286 --> 00:19:50.220
- Lovely to meet you.
- It's a pleasure to meet you.


00:19:55.193 --> 00:19:57.593
<i>- Look at you. You look like an old man.
- Bite me.</i>


00:19:57.662 --> 00:20:01.291
- Yeah, a cane or something there, buddy?
- I got your cane right here.


00:20:01.365 --> 00:20:03.833
- Um, sake?
- Sounds great. Sure.


00:20:03.901 --> 00:20:05.425
<i>Hai.</i>


00:20:05.503 --> 00:20:08.961
So, what do you do when you're not
traveling the world with this guy?


00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:11.474
Actually, I just became certified
to teach sixth-grade English.


00:20:11.542 --> 00:20:13.635
Really?
Well, that must be pretty fulfilling.


00:20:13.711 --> 00:20:17.238
No, I-


00:20:21.219 --> 00:20:24.655
<i>So, hey, Bru, you remember that Russian
hostess from the other night?</i>


00:20:24.722 --> 00:20:26.587
- No.
- Yeah, I called her.


00:20:26.657 --> 00:20:29.888
She's comin' in
for an audition on Wednesday.


00:20:29.961 --> 00:20:32.156
- Unbelievable, this guy.
- Some things never change.


00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:35.324
Hey, it's my job.


00:20:35.399 --> 00:20:37.128
<i>- Arigato.
- Thank you.</i>


00:20:37.201 --> 00:20:39.761
- What is it exactly that you do, Adam?
- Um-


00:20:39.837 --> 00:20:43.364
I, um, I rep models.


00:20:43.441 --> 00:20:46.535
Um, and I got this guy all the girls
he's workin' with the next two weeks.


00:20:46.611 --> 00:20:49.205
Ah. You guys make quite the team,
don't you?


00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:53.307
<i>- Certainly did.
- Three amigos of the international department.</i>


00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:59.719
<i>- To good friends.
- Kanpai.</i>


00:21:01.225 --> 00:21:03.557
Just perfect.


00:21:03.628 --> 00:21:08.122
<i>Eyes right to lens. Perfect.</i>


00:21:08.199 --> 00:21:09.564
<i>Right there. Hold that.</i>


00:21:09.634 --> 00:21:11.568
Perfect. Okay. Hold that.


00:21:11.636 --> 00:21:16.198
<i>Emi, can you bring that pipejust...
six inches out from your mouth.</i>


00:21:16.274 --> 00:21:18.674
<i>No, out. Right.</i>


00:21:18.743 --> 00:21:22.110
Okay. That's enough color.
Let's shoot some black-and-white.


00:21:26.784 --> 00:21:30.720
See, uh, right up there? That's my office,
right up there in the corner.


00:21:30.788 --> 00:21:33.552
<i>- That's your office?
- Clear frame, please. Bruno!</i>


00:21:33.624 --> 00:21:35.558
- Yeah?
- Be plenty of time for that later.


00:21:35.626 --> 00:21:37.856
<i>All right.</i>


00:21:41.299 --> 00:21:43.597
<i>Clear the frame, please.</i>


00:21:55.346 --> 00:21:57.280
