<i># Oh, oh #</i>


01:27:42.589 --> 01:27:47.219
<i>#I never thought I'd find #</i>


01:27:48.295 --> 01:27:52.925
<i>#A heart that fit with mine #</i>


01:27:53.000 --> 01:27:56.128
<i>#Sometimes the world is kind #</i>


01:27:56.203 --> 01:28:00.731
<i># You are good to me #</i>


